WEBVTT

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.140
<i>I was born in a corner of the 
Balsteros Imperial Palace.</i>

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.400
<i>My mother was a concubine of the emperor,</i>

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.080
<i>and I did chores in the palace.</i>

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.370
<i>Our existence was a secret to the world.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.130
<i>And as the revolution drew nearer,</i>

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.980
<i>we were kicked out of the palace.</i>

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:46.400
<i>Whenever we ran out of food, 
my mother would leave, late at night,</i>

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:49.400
<i>returning with food in the morning.</i>

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.720
I'm sorry, Mother...

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.910
I'm sorry...

00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:01.790
I'm sorry!

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:03.900
Forgive me, Ignacio.

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.670
For making you suffer this way...

00:01:06.670 --> 00:01:08.290
Forgive me.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:32.700
I'll kill you...

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.990
I'll kill you, Gregorio La Hire!

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.740
And then, Karl La Hire...

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:43.490
I'll kill you! You have it so easy...

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.620
I'll make you suffer like I have!

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:25.410
<b>Episode 10: 
Sky of Courage</b>

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.760
Igna and Kal haven't come back.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:27.710
No...

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.110
Who knows what those two boys are up to?

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.770
Maybe hitting each other.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:36.900
Hitting? Why?

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.320
They could be fighting over Ariel.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:43.320
What are you talking about? 
That makes no sense.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.980
I'm just kidding.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:50.350
But you know, guys sometimes do 
things that don't make any sense.

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:51.210
Yeah...

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:55.210
I'm sure that there are times 
when they have to do that.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:02.380
What's wrong?

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:04.940
You're going to let me kill you?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.060
Wh-What is it...

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:15.170
What is with you?

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:19.570
Ariel and Nina have far more guts than you.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.960
They're doing their jobs, as best they can.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.450
Unlike you... You just locked 
yourself in your room to cry.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.160
Shut up... What do you know?

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:35.500
Didn't you hear what Ariel said 
in front of your room?

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:45.760
I've decided to quit the flying school.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.510
Even after I've healed,

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:50.260
I guess I won't be able to handle a throttle.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:57.980
I'm sure you've realized how stupid you are!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.670
I'll tell you something else.

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.420
Tomorrow, Claire is leaving the school.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.200
She understands that, 
now that you know she's Nina,

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:26.180
if she keeps coming to school, it'll hurt you.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.300
You stole Claire's dreams of flying from her.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.180
Don't forget that.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.090
Ari...

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.190
I'm sorry for not considering your feelings...

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:55.450
But... I...

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.710
Nina Viento!

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.210
I...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.040
I...

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.710
An enemy attack?

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:33.450
Nina Viento has lost her power to read the wind.

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.750
So now, all I can do is send her out there...

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.420
Ignacio Axis.

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.880
Why did you involve yourself 
in the Wind Revolution?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:50.480
You can do whatever you like now.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:54.350
If you survive, you'll have another mission.

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:12.000
Enemy deploying at our front.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.320
Enemy sighted.

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:16.050
So that's the enemy's flying fortress.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.830
Another floating island, like Isla?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:21.920
Launch the observer!

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:49.030
We've got a clear channel from the observer.

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:53.230
The joint bomber front will 
engage the enemy fortress.

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:55.770
All escorts remaining on Isla

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.350
will be routed to Mercurius and Escorial.

00:07:58.350 --> 00:07:59.160
Yes, sir.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:01.840
We don't have enough escorts.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:05.430
The observation plane will 
have to dodge enemy fire,

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:07.660
while functioning as a spotter.

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:12.360
Then we'll need to rely on the students again?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.040
The hell is wrong with you?

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:25.400
Do you think their lives are worth nothing?!

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.110
Commander Leopold has issued an attack order

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.940
to the Centezual Flight School students.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:36.940
Your mission is to escort the 
<i>Luna Barco</i>'s observation plane.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.860
Defend the observation plane from 
enemy fighters, with your lives.

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:40.540
Repeat—

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:48.710
As of this moment, I am quitting the military.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:55.000
The request I am about to make 
comes from me, as an individual.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.020
Do not go on this mission.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:00.720
They're sacrificing your lives to buy 
themselves a few more minutes.

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:04.180
So they can judge the distance to the enemy.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.650
I will take full responsibility!

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:12.230
Get on the buses headed to the shelters.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.500
You have ten minutes.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.500
What should we do?

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.480
Desertion is a serious crime!

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:31.040
But if we go out there, we're sure to die.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.450
I... I don't want to die!

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:39.850
Wait!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.220
Noripii? What's wrong?

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.650
Let's get out of here!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.000
Nanako...

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.900
It's fine, you go.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:10:00.990
I'll stay here a little longer.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.220
What are you saying?

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.750
You aren't saying you're going to fight, are you?

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.540
This isn't like you, Noripii.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:13.510
Don't be weird.

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:15.050
Just go!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.550
Just go!

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.180
Noripii!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:28.980
Nanako, get going.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.480
I'll be Noriaki's partner.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.330
I won't let him do anything stupid... 
Don't worry.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.570
Now get going.

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:43.050
Benji...

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:46.040
Are you going to stay, too?

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.210
Let's talk outside.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.020
Guys! The enemy...

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:18.950
Calm down, Benji.

00:11:18.950 --> 00:11:21.990
If we go out there, they'll kill us.

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:25.990
As long as we don't do anything stupid, 
there are ways we can fight.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:28.690
Sharon...

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.190
I'm taller than you now.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.700
And stronger, too.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:41.970
I'll prove that I'm stronger than you.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:49.180
That now, I can protect you.

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:51.580
Benji...

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.310
I will come back.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.780
Believe in me, and wait.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.190
Promise me that you'll return.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:15.440
Okay.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.200
If you die, I'll never forgive you.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.960
I will come back.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:29.830
Jeez...

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.890
Noriaki and Benji, what are you thinking?

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:35.940
I'm going, as well.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:37.340
What?!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.320
I'm going, as well.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.150
Not you, too!

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.590
I want to protect you and everyone else.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.870
I don't want to run.

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:46.890
You idiot!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.640
That wasn't what I meant—

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:52.160
I know...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.500
I know how you feel.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:57.540
But this is who I am.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.920
I can't really say why,

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:03.960
but if I don't do anything here, I'll regret it.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:05.300
That's how I feel.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.010
I don't understand!

00:13:07.010 --> 00:13:09.430
I don't understand at all!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:11.930
I'm sorry.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:14.670
Idiot...

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.070
You're such an idiot...

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.280
Ari, let's go.

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:23.750
Chiharu...

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.480
Let's believe in him.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.030
You can't change a boy's mind once he's decided.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:33.530
Don't die, okay?

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.210
It's the ones who survive that will be sad...

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.920
But you can't fly without a partner.

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.170
I'll go with him.

00:13:56.030 --> 00:13:58.850
I'll take care of that idiot.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.610
Ignacio...

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.410
Hurry, everyone!

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.480
The bus is leaving.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:06.200
Let's go, Ari.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.490
Yeah.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.520
Nanako...

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:14.970
Noripii...

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.750
I still have things I want to say,

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:24.250
so you'd better come back, idiot!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:25.910
Yeah.

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:32.180
What are you thinking?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:34.920
I'm going to die, no matter what.

00:14:35.750 --> 00:14:39.440
So I'd rather die somewhere 
I can watch you die, also.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:47.690
<i>Mitsuo...</i>

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:52.570
<i>I never said I was sorry for the things I said.</i>

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.660
<i>I don't know how to apologize, but...</i>

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:00.290
<i>But I...</i>

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:05.420
<i>Fausto... Wolfgang...</i>

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.460
<i>I don't know if I have courage like yours.</i>

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:12.640
<i>But I...</i>

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:14.010
<i>Right now...</i>

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:20.980
<i>I'm going to fly!</i>

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.910
<i>Now...</i>

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.200
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.310
Multiple enemy fighters!

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.750
We're surrounded!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:44.920
Don't let them scare you!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.670
Double our AA defenses!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.920
How's the observer?

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.320
It's still fine.

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:52.370
But it's taking heavy fire. It's in trouble.

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:53.990
Enemy dreadnought is turning!

00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:56.150
It's preparing to fire.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:57.880
Prepare to fire on it!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:00.200
We can't let it hit us first!

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.580
Reinforcements have arrived from Escorial.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:03.600
It's the students!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.440
They came?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:24.470
When I give the signal, slide right.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.000
Until then, head straight forward.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.340
D-Don't tell me what to do!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.950
If you don't want to die, do as I say.

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.680
Slide!

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:42.880
You...

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:44.150
Stay focused.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:45.560
More are coming!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.310
The clouds...

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:49.860
Use the clouds to confuse them!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:50.980
The clouds?

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.830
What, are you scared?

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:53.610
I'm not scared!

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:01.160
Just head straight ahead.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.200
Don't lose track of which way we're pointing.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.530
Don't insult me.

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:06.570
I'll get away!

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:08.130
Who said we're running away?

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.380
I've lured them into a trap.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.100
<i>He took out three at once?</i>

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:26.800
Not bad.

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.320
Y-You, too...

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:30.020
Not you.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.730
I meant the enemy's deployment.

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.280
I kn-knew that!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.210
We've been separated from our wingmen!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.200
They're in danger!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.960
Noripii... Benji!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.680
No way! No way! No way!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.760
It's not possible!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.760
Noriaki, calm down!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:57.450
Use the clouds more!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.180
Stay away! Stay away! Stay away!

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:04.350
Over there!

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.850
I'll hide as best as I can!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.980
I won't die here...

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.530
I won't die here!

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:18.280
Amazing, Noriaki!

00:18:25.560 --> 00:18:27.030
The clouds dissipated!

00:18:27.030 --> 00:18:29.510
But the enemy isn't following us...

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.330
Amazing, Noriaki.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.300
You're a genius at running away.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:34.760
Am I?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.800
But...

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:40.180
We're going over there?

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.190
Yes.

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:43.250
We have to protect the observation plane.

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.410
<i>Mitsuo...</i>

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:49.720
<i>You flew right into the midst 
of a battle like this.</i>

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:51.830
<i>That's amazing...</i>

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.440
<i>You have a lot of courage.</i>

00:18:56.470 --> 00:18:59.050
<i>I just can't do it!</i>

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.190
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:02.280
<i>I can't do this...</i>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.450
<i>You're wrong.</i>

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.870
<i>We're all the same.</i>

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.960
<i>We all have an amazing power within us.</i>

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.130
<i>Believe.</i>

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:14.860
<i>The only difference is if you 
believe or if you don't believe.</i>

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.970
Believe...

00:19:25.650 --> 00:19:29.110
Have courage... Have courage!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:46.000
The enemy is firing on us?

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:47.380
No direct hits!

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.110
Prepare for the next barrage.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.610
Don't let them beat us!

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:53.040
Fire the main guns!

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.300
How close are we to the enemy?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.830
15,000 meters...

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.220
18,000 meters.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:04.800
The clouds are blocking our vision!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.180
We need spotting from the observation plane.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.910
Benji!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.770
I'll do my best.

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:21.400
I need to get closer...

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.330
No way...

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:31.830
Damn it!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.210
W-We've lost contact with the observer!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.460
It's been shot down!

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:42.040
Enemy destroyer is deploying smoke!

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.680
A smokescreen?

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.910
A smokescreen, as well?

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:52.520
Noriaki, look over there...

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.140
An enemy observer?

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:59.070
They've gone over the smoke screen 
to get closer and fire at us.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:03.700
We can't see them at all, but they can see us?

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.950
We have no way to win now.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.990
What do we do?

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:19.040
We can still do something, right?

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:22.340
There's something we can do.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:25.840
Yes.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:27.930
I have to do it, right?

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.850
Even if I'm a genius at running away...

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:34.340
You can run when we're finished...

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.730
As fast as you can!

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.430
Yeah.

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:39.770
That's right...

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:43.400
Let's go, Noriaki.

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:51.030
Noriaki?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.160
What are you doing?

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:55.000
Damn it!

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.420
I'm not dying here!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.000
I'm not going to lose!

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:32.930
It's me, Ignacio.

00:23:33.300 --> 00:23:34.590
When you choose a weapon,

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:37.320
you select one that's suited to your height.

